Yes! Please post with the hashtag as well!

636
00:45:28,606 --> 00:45:32,106
呟いてください！#ReGLOSS2周年
Please tweet! #ReGLOSS2ndAnniversary

637
00:45:32,606 --> 00:45:35,306
はい、じゃあ次の曲、いいですか？
Alright, are you ready for the next song?

638
00:45:35,306 --> 00:45:37,606
次の楽曲はなんと！
The next song is actually...

639
00:45:37,606 --> 00:45:43,106
本日公開されたばかりのあの曲！
that song that was just released today!

640
00:45:43,606 --> 00:45:47,106
うわーー！ / じゃあ、立ち位置につきますか！
Whoa! / Alright, shall we get into position?

641
00:45:47,106 --> 00:45:49,306
はい！
Yes!

642
00:45:49,306 --> 00:45:51,106
何の曲かな？
I wonder what song it is?

