言い訳めいたハートに従って
following a heart full of excuses.

647
00:46:15,606 --> 00:46:18,906
現実は今半即興なプロットです
Reality right now is a semi-improvised plot.

648
00:46:18,906 --> 00:46:21,906
取り憑かれるオーバーな芝居
An exaggerated performance that takes over.

649
