00:49:35,606 --> 00:49:37,106
2025.12.16 Tue.
[On-Screen: Tuesday, December 16, 2025]

704
00:49:37,106 --> 00:49:41,106
Flashpoint ReGLOSS 1st Live
[On-Screen: Flashpoint: ReGLOSS 1st Live]

705
00:49:41,106 --> 00:49:44,106
ARIAKE ARENA
[On-Screen: ARIAKE ARENA]

