はい！えー、チケットは、S席、A席、B席の3種類です。
Yes! The tickets come in three categories: S, A, and B seats.

752
00:52:26,454 --> 00:52:28,954
1次先行はこのあと、21時...
The first round of pre-sales starts after this, at 9 PM...

